# nocheck: persona-block-rationale — Penpot's login lives on the query-routed SPA screen /?screen=auth-login (files/playwright/_shared.js:92), which the helper's ${base}/login probing never reaches, and its OIDC entry is a bare "OpenID" text node (files/playwright/_shared.js:128-135) rather than a link or button named log in / sign in / sso; under OIDC the native password form is disabled outright via PENPOT_FLAGS (vars/main.yml, README "Identity"). Admin auth is covered by files/playwright/test-login-oidc-admin.js, test-login-ldap-admin.js and test-login-native.js (see README "Testing").
